        "target_object": "ONX_CALIBRATION_obj_577798f047",
        "query_signature": "The predictor chooses $p_t\\in[0,1]$ while the adversary simultaneously chooses $y_t\\in\\{0,1\\}$. Both may use past predictions and outcomes, but the adversary choosing $y_t$ cannot see the current realized randomized prediction $p_t$. After both act, $p_t,y_t$ is revealed. No true conditional mean or privileged prediction interface is supplied. Past feedback may be stored and reused computationally; no additional historical or sample queries are available beyond the explicitly declared interface.",
